      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她常常说“该这么做才行”。\n这令我有点在意\n其中有多少是她自己的意愿？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3958f9af8572d698a4a8e4f76614acb0722b2de51dd7591738b7e3c6004a2bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
